{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "061698e6b1838bee212bbcbfd1639d4ca1974eaaea2489d073560261d70a8a87", "ja": "私達のサークルへようこそ！！！", "zh": "欢迎来到我们的社团！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3a0091c55e18e58d790d8c5be3d79a4d821cc62804a889dc0fe29c3f921a97b5", "ja": "ミリ大マンガ研究会に入会希望者がやって\n来た。高校生でプロデビューした小説家の\n冬川緑生だ。シンカ、りこ、Licht、\nちなの部員4名の弱小サークルは神作家を\n迎え、同人誌即売会に向けて始動する。", "zh": "希望加入百万大学漫画研究会的人来了。她是高中生就出道的小说家\n冬川緑生。由シンカ、りこ、Licht、ちな等4名成员组成的弱小社团迎来了大神作家，开始为同人志即卖会行动起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1000_narration", "source_sha256": "70502e18d7d33d22b3a51de1ff5bffa0349b82ac37aacd7b4929817618a57fa8", "ja": "とある大学、\nとあるマンガ研究サークルの部室にて……", "zh": "某所大学，\n某漫画研究社团的活动室里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "afe4a253ab5caf535626ed2a434717db054349fb415f9ca18c229548732b9cdb", "ja": "あーっ、最っ高だーーー！！！\n『12beast Apocalypse』こと、エト戦記！", "zh": "啊——太棒啦———！！！\n通称“生肖战记”的《12beast Apocalypse》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "33749db85af82482c5965b2db0b2180984dd94480eb127351f534d77138dbd3e", "ja": "今まで匂わされてたけど、\nアニメで丑寅編やるのは熱すぎるよっ！", "zh": "之前一直都有所暗示，不过要在动画里做丑寅篇，实在是太燃了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "5b09a2a64dae96494da0ada4b3b6564b158924dc6cf7db00e7729ec59d236f19", "ja": "そして放映直後に☆5実装ピックアップガシャ……！\nめ、メディアミックスの力～……っ！", "zh": "而且就在播出后马上推出☆5实装精选扭蛋……！\n这、这就是跨媒体企划的力量～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "1eb0ad8df60d77b58c2ba7f564b74fe3cd20fbcaa027ff232e08ebc556fcfc0a", "ja": "待望の鬼門、裏鬼門のメンバーも揃って……\nはぁ、また薄い本が厚くなるな～。", "zh": "盼望已久的鬼门、里鬼门成员也凑齐了……\n唉，薄本又要变厚了呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "40845ae3ba4ceaba3c0c08f60695184fd558ee302847bae20b413d81da25346e", "ja": "財布は薄くなりますけどね……。今回の☆5、いつに\nなったらこのスマホに来てくれるんですか～！？", "zh": "钱包倒是会变薄……这次的☆5，到底什么时候才肯来我的手机里呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "f58b678122c9bce42851542b6905d46846d2c6cf22e68662f2289a8311f5b7de", "ja": "面白いよね～、エト戦記。\n私も本出そっかな？", "zh": "埃托战记很有意思呢～。我也出本书怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "da661d0fc8db13e69348a9282e67eb9102a3176263e8177b6ae9bd73d9e98329", "ja": "えっ！！？？\nLicht（リヒト）ちゃんのエト戦記本！？", "zh": "诶！！？？\n莉希特的小埃特战记！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "ba14453dc0bd9279c1312fbf7f958f0f50f36d4c011739724e657f6c93c4a49c", "ja": "そ、それは読みたい……！\n読みたすぎるっ！！！！", "zh": "那、那个我想看……！\n太想看了！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "514e8df00c933d44bebf5db939530b0b30e5088f69c0032f008beb7295e4d961", "ja": "ほんと？\nわ～い、嬉しいな～♪", "zh": "真的？\n哇～好开心啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1010_se", "source_sha256": "baaf911df9fe63ce981902b045833b47a18a184b223de842d05a3bb183354658", "ja": "ガチャガチャ、バタン", "zh": "哐啷哐啷，砰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "0fe51a04d17f2b93b23e77855ee080d8ad59d36de0c3ebfb5c77fc206505fe6b", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさまー！", "zh": "大家，辛苦啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "65b1d2c3be9bb1b8d47c36a8eb0274d227946051f8efb39a97139bf56e3d4d5b", "ja": "あ、ちな先輩！\n……と、そちらの方は……？", "zh": "啊，千奈前辈！\n……还有，那位是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "a11a92627113a2c1d40240a654751c75ac6e311ae07511f8d66cae01db84388c", "ja": "なんと、入会希望者！　……といっても、私の従姉妹で\n幼馴染なんだけど。最近エト戦記にハマったんだって。", "zh": "没想到是想入会的人！……不过，她是我的表姐，也是一起长大的朋友。听说她最近迷上了《艾托战记》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "b276b49a785f742e2559e6f4638fe7e8235b5cdc8de5084a315d55192a85a232", "ja": "おお、待望の！！　それじゃあ……せっかく\n全員揃ってるし、自己紹介といきましょう！", "zh": "哦哦，盼望已久的成员！！那就……难得大家都到齐了，来做个自我介绍吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "2bf45e5962bccabeb155f5a68b91db90a2333155eaf640e4ffbbdff45cb5dd7e", "ja": "アタシは黒嵜（くろさき）シンカ……あ、もちろん\nペンネームです！　ここだとそっちで呼び合ってて。", "zh": "我是黑崎（くろさき）新香……啊，当然是笔名！在这里大家都用这个名字互相称呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "6e7698bf224186ab3767bb8ea1667d741b6eba522f10c85c548be96c860411db", "ja": "シンカちゃんと同じく、絵描きの\n蜜屋（みつや）りこです！　同志は大歓迎ですよ～！！", "zh": "和シンカ一样，我是画画的蜜屋りこ！欢迎志同道合的人哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "8b18b3b3c9ef5696ab022500e20cc99c2caab61d9315eeac7f0d25c1513f5a40", "ja": "Lichtって言います。私も絵で、\nこの中だと一番年上かな？　よろしくね♪", "zh": "我叫Licht。我也是画画的，\n在这里面应该是年纪最大的吧？请多关照啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "5448c5109ca225be814a17f2f0b10c92ec4cd8f97e1ba3c33c7b4dcf232e5c38", "ja": "え、私もするの？　コスプレネーム『ちな』こと、\n緑川千花夏（みどりかわ　ちかげ）です。", "zh": "诶，我也要自我介绍吗？我的Cos名叫『ちな』，我是绿川千花夏（Chikage Midorikawa）。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "130b79b64f43fcf7f8013d4566229190efad7d8fa1bc647a075148b88e6f9df5", "ja": "衣装を作るのが大好きなコスプレイヤー！\nもちろん、即売会では売り子もやってるよ。", "zh": "我是最喜欢制作服装的Cosplayer！当然也会在同人展会上帮忙卖东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "260658ad2fedcd55562ca51fa1d8bcdc0dd517f65381cb0b0820738a16907e5b", "ja": "緑川冬生（みどりかわ　とうい）です。ペンネームは、\n冬川緑生（ふゆかわ　あおい）で活動しています。", "zh": "我叫绿川冬生（みどりかわ　とうい）。笔名是冬川绿生（ふゆかわ　あおい），平时以这个名字进行创作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "f1eee490eda5bee8bdb36694ea2ca1c2660f2e74671189c9984962c8d741233a", "ja": "え？　冬川緑生って……あの冬川緑生！？\n高校生でプロデビューした、小説家の！？", "zh": "诶？冬川绿生……就是那个冬川绿生！？\n高中生就出道的小说家！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "7771984c8e3878c31af70ceabede4411d756b3c28b9d3e7c7bd6f16b4b519409", "ja": "単行本は次々とヒットを飛ばし、映画化も\n控えているはずの……まさしく神作家ですよ！！", "zh": "单行本一部接一部地大获成功，而且听说还要影视化……这可真是名副其实的神级作家啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "10102a80976420dc5d9bb1fd570dcc3ed189d8750fe516d0334168d4ba5fa8c8", "ja": "この部員4名の弱小サークルが絵と文字、\nそれぞれの神作家を抱える事になるなんて……！？", "zh": "没想到这个只有4名成员的弱小社团，竟然能拥有分别负责绘画和文字的神级作家……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "f06ab75c3e3792e3f14b16631a508de030d4c6585136a0dbebf5df6d710d56e7", "ja": "あの、質問なんですが……こちらのサークルでは、\n会誌などは出していないんですか？", "zh": "那个，我想问一下……这个社团没有发行社刊之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "c1f595f514b3bbccaf9105cde62a85d8744432a3089a505f33aed5875a237cde", "ja": "それが……みんな個人サークルもあるから、\nなかなか都合もつけにくくってですね……。", "zh": "这个嘛……因为大家也都有自己的个人社团，实在很难协调时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "ebfacc9cd9f36a7ce4712a577469495235844170016d3e11652f2a8aa6847229", "ja": "1年に1回は会誌出さなきゃいけないから、\n学祭前とかに大慌てで入稿～って感じかな。", "zh": "因为1年必须得出1次会刊，\n感觉就会在学园祭前手忙脚乱地交稿～这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "bd6d34a574f703ec2194c8d417fc97c135efd25c1d25ad70b94a785e2d933923", "ja": "でも、せっかくみんなで同じものにハマってるん\nですから出したいですよね～。エト戦記本！", "zh": "不过，难得大家都迷上了同一个东西，当然想出一本吧～《エト战记》的同人志！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "77e73dcb76bfec3a28217779a4bc02c3d0d29dc81d5170d4b240977873bc07bd", "ja": "それなら私が編集をやりましょうか？　\n私はいま、サークル活動をしていませんし。", "zh": "那就由我来负责编辑吧？\n我现在也没有参加社团活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "1d51e9a1c7ae5d9f060806e61ef779ee154b5c10b74afc795c92dd98b52ae627", "ja": "えっ、いいんですか！？　今ならコミベ狙えるし、\nちょうどいいタイミングかも……？", "zh": "咦，可以吗！？现在说不定能瞄准Comic V，是个正好的时机也说不定……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "55e9fae2df4cef07186c8ddc5ad6ec4393f79f13305177b31cee8d441772ed82", "ja": "説明しましょう！　コミベとは『コミック＆ノベル\nコンベンション』の略、超大型同人誌即売会の事です！", "zh": "来解释一下吧！所谓コミベ，是『漫画＆小说同人展』的缩写，也就是超大型同人志即卖会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "18589d290ff02b3314698346943c6e27c0ddd6894de437105656e2bd1b0b2ca8", "ja": "りこちゃん、誰に話しかけてるの？\nもしかして、こっちの人かな？", "zh": "莉绪，你是在跟谁说话呀？\n难道说，是屏幕前的这位吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1032_002chi", "source_sha256": "77087287672284e98651af828437691548e85e5aa25211a755ef230225a4afae", "ja": "サークルに入る以上、こういう手伝いをするのは\n当然ですから。コミベ参加、いいと思います。", "zh": "既然加入了社团，帮这种忙也是理所当然的。\n参加Comic & Novel Convention，我觉得不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1033_027say", "source_sha256": "9d4bec51256f4ffabe8f14839e8d7a5aac965aa9802c8264b2f147026ee42b98", "ja": "私も手伝えるし……うん、いいんじゃない？\n次はコミベで、エト戦記本だね！", "zh": "我也能帮上忙……嗯，挺好的吧？下次就在同人展上出《艾特战记》的本吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0231_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_01_1034_043nor", "source_sha256": "e1cb7ab5b2165d92935e84417bd938dc7c4fb666aa5c82083a772efee21ce844", "ja": "おお……会誌、楽しみになってきたね！\n気合い入れて描くぞーっ！", "zh": "哦哦……开始期待社刊了呢！我要卯足劲画啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
